      ":question/problem": "Consider the following first-order linear ODE for the function $y=y(x):$\n\n$$\n\\left(x\\right)\\cdot \\frac{dy}{dx}-\\left(x\\right)\\cdot y=x^{3}\n$$\n\nWrite the equation in the form $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(yI(x))=I(x)Q(x),$ where $I(x)$ is an integrating factor.\n\nAssume $x>0$.",
